r="middle" class="loopText" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;"><tspan x="501">[Health check]</tspan></text></g><g data-et="note" data-id="i4"><rect x="500" y="291" fill="#EDF2AE" stroke="#666" width="150" height="58" class="note" data-look="neo"></rect><text x="575" y="296" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="noteText" dy="1em" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;"><tspan x="575">Rational thoughts </tspan></text><text x="575" y="315" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="noteText" dy="1em" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;"><tspan x="575">prevail!</tspan></text></g><text x="272" y="89" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="messageText" dy="1em" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;">Hello John, how are you?</text><line x1="76" y1="120" x2="468" y2="120" class="messageLine0" data-et="message" data-id="i0" data-from="Alice" data-to="John" stroke-width="2" stroke="none" marker-end="url(#mermaid-svg-0-arrowhead)" style="fill: none;"></line><text x="476" y="180" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="messageText" dy="1em" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;">Fight against hypochondria</text><path d="M 476,211 C 536,201 536,241 476,231" class="messageLine0" data-et="message" data-id="i2" data-from="John" data-to="John" stroke-width="2" stroke="none" marker-end="url(#mermaid-svg-0-arrowhead)" style="fill: none;"></path><text x="278" y="364" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="messageText" dy="1em" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;">Great!</text><line x1="474" y1="395" x2="82" y2="395" class="messageLine1" data-et="message" data-id="i5" data-from="John" data-to="Alice" stroke-width="2" stroke="none" marker-end="url(#mermaid-svg-0-arrowhead)" style="stroke-dasharray: 3, 3; fill: none;"></line><text x="378" y="410" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="messageText" dy="1em" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;">How about you?</text><line x1="474" y1="441" x2="282" y2="441" class="messageLine0" data-et="message" data-id="i6" data-from="John" data-to="Bob" stroke-width="2" stroke="none" marker-end="url(#mermaid-svg-0-arrowhead)" style="fill: none;"></line><text x="372" y="456" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="middle" alignment-baseline="middle" class="messageText" dy="1em" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;">Jolly good!</text><line x1="276" y1="487" x2="468" y2="487" class="messageLine1" data-et="message" data-id="i7" data-from="Bob" data-to="John" stroke-width="2" stroke="none" marker-end="url(#mermaid-svg-0-arrowhead)" style="stroke-dasharray: 3, 3; fill: none;"></line></svg></div>{"\n"}<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="sequence-diagram-forest-theme-directive">Sequence Diagram (forest theme directive)<a href="#sequence-diagram-forest-theme-directive" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Sequence Diagram (forest theme directive)" title="Direct link to Sequence Diagram (forest theme directive)" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p>It is possible to override default config locally with Mermaid text directives such as:</p>{"\n"}<div style="--prism-color: #393A34; --prism-background-color: #f6f8fa;" class="language-text codeBlockContainer_jDV4 theme-code-block"><div class="codeBlockContent_cKMj"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_Gebt thin-scrollbar" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250);"><code class="codeBlockLines_FJaf"><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">%%&#123;init: &#123; "theme": "forest" &#125; &#125;%%</span><br /></div></code></pre><div class="buttonGroup_KXnS"><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code to clipboard" title="Copy" class="clean-btn"><span class="copyButtonIcons_